# Git LFS — large binary assets
#
# v2.5 Kronos ONNX checkpoint (~410 MB per ADR-0027 Q12).
# Run `git lfs install` before checking out or committing ONNX files.
# See crates/forecast/README.md § LFS bootstrap for the full procedure.
crates/forecast/assets/*.onnx filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
